  "description": "Ytdlp.NET is a fluent, strongly-typed, and immutable .NET wrapper around yt-dlp. It provides a fully asynchronous, event-driven interface for downloading, metadata extraction, and media processing from YouTube and hundreds of other platforms.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
